    <string name="tutorial_step">STEP %1$d OF %2$d</string>
    <string name="tutorial_one_title">PICK A LANE</string>
    <string name="tutorial_one_body">The token enters from one of three launch lanes. Changing the lane costs nothing and redraws the whole route.</string>
    <string name="tutorial_two_title">PLACE AND ROTATE</string>
    <string name="tutorial_two_body">Tap an empty lattice slot to drop a bumper, then tap the bumper again to turn it a quarter step. The budget is strict.</string>
    <string name="tutorial_three_title">LIGHT THE GATES IN ORDER</string>
    <string name="tutorial_three_body">Magenta, then cyan, then lime builds the combo chain. A wrong colour or a barrier kick breaks it back to zero.</string>
    <string name="tutorial_four_title">LAND BEFORE THE CLOCK</string>
    <string name="tutorial_four_body">The rush clock drops your current plan when it runs out, so read the dashed route and commit before zero.</string>

